# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
# Docling and its model weights live here, never in .venv — the core's 4-dependency
# footprint is a measured claim (scripts/compare_tools.py) and must stay verifiable.
.venv-bench/
# Downloaded evaluation corpus. Excluding the *contents* rather than the directory
# itself, because git will not descend into an excluded directory and the negation
# below would never fire.
.corpus/*
# The hand-labelled reading order is not downloadable and is the only non-circular
# yardstick the project has — it is source, not data.
!.corpus/truth/
# Regenerable: .venv-bench/Scripts/python.exe scripts/docling_dump.py <pdf>
.corpus/docling/
